      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The offline banner sits at the top of the\ncontent, under the window bar, and pushes\nthe screen down instead of covering it\n(OFFLINE-1, decision 20). Screen readers\nhear it once.",
      "originalText": "The offline banner sits at the top of the\ncontent, under the window bar, and pushes\nthe screen down instead of covering it\n(OFFLINE-1, decision 20). Screen readers\nhear it once.",
