      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Offline the app calls no server. Hearts and\nAdd to list are disabled (dashed); the heart\nstill shows on hover (Severance here), and\nclicking it repeats the banner's words in a\nmessage. Nothing is kept to send later.",
